<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Mosega</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1837</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Mosega was fought in January 1837 near present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zeerust">Zeerust</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/south-africa">South Africa</a>, when <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/voortrekkers">Voortrekkers</a> under Hendrik Potgieter and Gert Maritz, with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/griqua">Griqua</a> and Tswana allies, attacked the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ndebele-kingdom">Ndebele</a> settlement at Mosega. Many Ndebele were killed and thousands of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cattle">cattle</a> taken. After further defeats later that year, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mzilikazi">Mzilikazi</a> led the Ndebele north across the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/limpopo">Limpopo</a> into present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zimbabwe">Zimbabwe</a>.</p></div>
